@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+---
+'tauri-runtime': 'minor:enhance'
+'tauri': 'minor:enhance'
+---
+
+Add runtime-owned new-window opener tokens and an opt-in window-builder hook for custom runtimes. Existing native opener construction and Wry behavior are preserved; unsupported runtime-owned openers fail before window creation. Runtime-neutral callers can use the optional native and runtime opener accessors instead of the legacy native-only accessor.
